  "id": "SD-SB-47-2019",
  "scope": "state:sd",
  "title": "Senate Bill No. 47 (94th Session, 2019): An Act to repeal and revise certain provisions regarding permits to carry a concealed pistol",
  "urls": [
    "https://sdlegislature.gov/Session/Bill/9374/51605",
